Reused work
-----------
Ideas and a small amount of code in CodePuff were adapted from the author's own project Metacognition
(https://github.com/luizbizzio/metacognition, Apache License 2.0, same copyright holder):

  - the approach of observing a coding agent through its hook events and recognizing what a tool call is;
  - the idea of a small pixel critter drawn from lit blocks (a bright top, a front, a shaded side).
    The "Claude" character in CodePuff is a new drawing in that spirit, rebuilt on CodePuff's own pixel canvas;
    no artwork file was copied.

Nothing from Metacognition's reflection, strategy-learning, advice-injection or verification-policy code is included.

Third-party code and assets
---------------------------
CodePuff has no runtime dependencies. All pixel art, animations and color logic are original to this project.

